  unitName: Scylla
  unitId: 20072
  unitNumber: 90
  description: A magical being from legends of sailors whose top half is a beautiful
    woman and bottom half is multiple snakes. More powerful Ramia, sailors often
    tell stories of how ships prepped to exterminate them were sunk as soon as they
    set sail. There is a tale that says she was a queen cursed by a sea witch due
    to a grudge.
  summonDesc: You're cute, aren't you...<br>Take me with you and let my <br>claws
    can do the talking!
  fusionDesc: You know what I like!<br>Come in, I'll treat you right!
  evoDesc: Love and hate are two sides of the same coin.<br>Will you let me love
    you?
  element: 2
  rarity: 2
